"""
Banana Scope PH: Philippine Banana Production Analytics (2010–2026)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
Main Interactive Web Application & Advanced Analytics Engine
Built with Streamlit & Plotly Express.

Visual Identity: Neumorphic UI/UX Architecture & Tropical Philippine AgTech
Official Color Palette:
  • Soft Cream          (#FCF0BC) - Main background and Neumorphic surface base
  • Banana Yellow       (#FBE05A) - Important buttons, highlights, active states
  • Golden Orange       (#D78601) - Secondary accents, shock metrics, warm shadows
  • Olive Green         (#849B0F) - Navigation, headers, structural indicators
  • Banana Leaf Green   (#95AC29) - Positive growth indicators, chart series
  • Deep Forest Green   (#055922) - Primary text, bold headers, active emphasis

Developed for Fundamentals of Data Analytics
Leuteboro National High School (DepEd MIMAROPA, Oriental Mindoro)
Supervised by Sir Aldrin D. Magtibay, Teacher V

Research Team:
  1. Krishia Mae R. Layag (Project Lead & Data Pipeline Engineer)
  2. Ann Ehra V. Avelino (Dashboard & UI/UX Design Lead)
  3. Hannah Aeshell V. Perez (Data Analytics & Documentation Lead)
"""

